  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "おおきな　くちから　しょうげきはを\nまきおこして　あいてを　こうげきする。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "큰 입으로 충격파를\n일으켜서 상대를 공격한다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "從張大的口中\n發射衝擊波攻擊對手。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur ouvre la bouche pour envoyer\nune onde de choc qui frappe l’ennemi.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Das Ziel wird mit einer Schockwelle angegriffen,\ndie aus dem offenen Maul des Anwenders kommt.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Abre mucho la boca y libera una onda de choque que\nataca al objetivo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa spalanca la bocca e genera un’onda\nd’urto che colpisce il bersaglio.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The target is attacked with a shock wave generated\nby the user’s gaping mouth.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "大きな　口から　衝撃波を\nまきおこして　相手を　攻撃する。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "从大大的口中\n掀起冲击波攻击对手。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
